  "description": "Provides Dapper type handlers for the UUID library, enabling seamless integration with database operations. Features include binary and string storage options, thread-safe implementation, comprehensive error handling, and efficient database type mapping. Optimized for both performance and flexibility across different .NET platforms and database systems.",
